{"kind": "mod", "id": 2808, "name": "Map Progression", "slug": "map-progression", "teaser": "Unlock maps based on your progress into the game. Start out with just Ground Zero. Fully configurable!", "owner_name": "sorenbyte", "downloads": 3567, "favourites": 31, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.sorenbyte.sptmapprogression", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Locations", "category_id": 8, "updated_at": "2026-08-02T02:55:39.000000Z", "created_at": "2026-07-08T06:13:15.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-07-08T06:13:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.13", "latest_version": "1.5.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<h1>I WILL BE UPDATING THIS MOD TO 4.1.0 BUT I CANT DO SO UNTIL I HAVE SOME FREE TIME SO NO ETA</h1>\n<h2>A mod that introduces map progression like in live Tarkov!</h2>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Maps Locked</strong>&gt; By default every map in the game is locked except for Ground Zero.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Unlocking Maps</strong>&gt; In order to unlock a map you must complete its specific requirements.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Map Requirements</strong>&gt; To see the requirements for a specific map you can simply hover over the lock icon.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Scav Requirements</strong>&gt; If you want to run a map as a Scav you must survive on that map as a PMC enough times.</p>\n<p>&lt;<strong>Configuring</strong>&gt; If the mod is too difficult or unbalanced for your mod setup, you can change every requirement through the client config! (press F12 and find the mods name)</p>\n<hr />\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<p><strong>1.</strong> Move the downloaded zip to your SPT folder</p>\n<p><strong>2.</strong> Unzip the .zip file with a tool like 7-zip</p>\n<p><strong>3.</strong> Launch your game and enjoy the mod!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>Preview Image</h2>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SrGJ0eb.jpeg\" alt=\"Preview Image\" /></p>\n<h2>Preview Image With Tooltips</h2>\n<p>These are the things that pop up when you hover over the locked icon of a map.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S76UCyb.jpeg\" alt=\"Preview Image With Tooltips\" /></p>\n<h2>Future Plans</h2>\n<p>&lt;&gt; More requirements (Give me some suggestions!)</p>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Move map requirement config to a server mod.</p>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Add direct support for Fika (Not allowing map queue if a party member doesn’t have it unlocked)</p>\n<h2>Known Issues</h2>\n<p>&lt;&gt; Transiting with Fika installed will not fulfill the transit requirement.</p>\n<p>To any mod developers who view my mod and think they can help me with modding, or see a problem in my code, please let me know what I can do better! Thanks.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 5537, "downloads": 213, "published_at": "2026-07-08T06:20:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2808/map-progression/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 7225, "downloads": 77, "published_at": "2026-07-09T01:04:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2808/map-progression/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.1.1", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "content_length": 7343, "downloads": 213, "published_at": "2026-07-09T02:24:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2808/map-progression/1.1.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "4.0.13", "cont